  {
   "topic": "Complement",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The NPN counterpart is the 2SC2873."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Gain grades and marking",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The top of the package carries a two-letter device code: NO for the O grade (hFE 70 to 140) and NY for the Y grade (hFE 120 to 240)."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Assembly and materials",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Moisture sensitivity is level 1 under J-STD-020, with a lead-free reflow peak of 260 °C. The mold compound is UL 94V-0 rated, RoHS compliant and halogen free. The leads are solder plated and solderable to MIL-STD-750 Method 2026."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Ratings in brief",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Dissipation is 500 mW at 25 °C ambient with a junction-to-ambient thermal resistance of 250 °C/W; storage and junction temperature both span -55 to +150 °C."
  }
